---
description: Four-part preview versions, exact game compatibility, and tagged releases
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the repository's `AGENTS.md` release rules and `docs/RELEASES.md` checklist.
Previews use `0.x.x.x`. Every release must identify its exact supported game build
in `compatibility.json` and its GitHub release notes. Never claim that a newer game
build is compatible without checking its code and completing relevant tests.
